// Author: Calvin Quint
// GitHub: https://github.com/calvin-quint/docs/blob/main/01-detection-engineering/kql/identity-governance/app_consent_activity.kql
// OAuth Application Consent Activity
// MITRE ATT&CK: Initial Access — Steal Application Access Token (T1528);
//               Persistence — Account Manipulation: Additional Cloud
//               Credentials (T1098.001)
// Detects: All OAuth application consent grants tenant-wide. Baseline/hunting
//          query for illicit consent grant attacks — a user tricked into
//          approving a malicious app's permission scopes gives an attacker
//          durable, MFA-independent access to mail/files without ever
//          touching the user's password.
CloudAppEvents
| where ActionType == "Consent to application."
